; INACTIVE RECIPE. Every definition below is commented out intentionally.
; Adding a selectable gender does not require an NPC mapping.
;
; Before enabling this recipe:
; 1. Find the exact specific_character ID of an existing NPC in your installation.
;    A broad character_profile class, visible name, or portrait ID is not enough.
; 2. Replace replace_with_verified_specific_character below with that real ID.
; 3. Replace my_mixed_gender with the installed gender ID to assign to this NPC.
; 4. Check that no other active mapping assigns that NPC to a different gender.
; 5. Uncomment this block and activate a uniquely named .ltx file in packs/.
;
; [my_verified_npc_mapping]
; kind = npc_map
; mapping_type = specific_character
; entries = my_verified_npc_entries
;
; [my_verified_npc_entries]
; replace_with_verified_specific_character = my_mixed_gender
;
; This only classifies the existing NPC for managed Azazel possession.
; It creates no spawns and does not alter the NPC model, voice, or portrait.
; Leave the block commented until both the NPC and target gender are verified.
